# Steps:
# 1. Open https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/mmnsovgpmojjeqajbcfo/settings/api
# 2. Copy Project URL into VITE_SUPABASE_URL
# 3. Copy the anon / publishable key into VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# 4. Rename this file to .env.local for local development
# 5. Add the same vars in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables

